# Public browser configuration only — never put a backend secret (e.g. PATHORA_ADMIN_PASSWORD)
# in a VITE_* variable. Everything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the built JS and shipped to
# the browser as plain text.
#
# Leave this empty for local development — the Vite dev server proxies relative /api/v1 calls
# straight to http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.ts), so no CORS setup is needed and no
# base URL needs to be configured.
#
# For a deployed build, set this to the deployed backend's own API base, for example:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.pathora.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
